"ip6tables has a restrictive INPUT default policy; individual rules may allow "
"exceptions."
msgstr ""
"ip6tables ha una policy INPUT predefinita restrittiva; singole regole "
"possono consentire eccezioni."

#: crates/linux-defender-core/src/audit/firewall.rs:748
